      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DEMBE (1) raced parked but toughed out a win last start at Wagga. Freshened since but kept up to the mark with a trial win. Well served by the ace draw and strikes at 50 per cent here. JILLIBY ILLUSION (3) came from the second row to win three back at Bendigo and has been beaten only about 4m from wider draws than this in both outings since. Two-time winner here and should get her chance from a good draw. OWEN THE SAINTS (5) overcame a back row draw to score narrowly last start at Charlton, giving him two wins and two placings from the past four outings. Has a handy record at this circuit and distance. Big chance. ASSIGNED (2) led from a similar draw in a last-start win by 7 metres at Kilmore so should be able to go forward again.",
